   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">LAS VEGAS, NV - JUNE 22:  An oversized Cozy Coupe by Little Tikes is displayed at the MGA Entertainment booth at the Licensing Expo 2016 at the Mandalay Bay Convention Center on June 22, 2016 in Las Vegas, Nevada.  (Photo by Gabe Ginsberg/Getty Images)</rdf:li>
